      "content": "When you feel completely erased, the weight of trying to be seen becomes unbearable. Please know that even if your connections feel severed, there are people who exist who *do* care, even if they aren't in your immediate circle. If you feel like you can't reach anyone you know, consider reaching out to a professional hotline or mental health service; they are there to listen without judgment. You don't have to carry this crushing feeling entirely by yourself.",
